    "about.banner.title": "Our Story",
    "about.breadcrumb.current": "About Us",
    "about.cta.btn": "Call +32 13 77 14 95",
    "about.cta.desc": "Feel free to drop by our terrace or our atmospheric brasserie, or call us directly for more information.",
    "about.cta.title": "Craving a Cosy Afternoon or Evening?",
    "about.story1.p1": "Restaurant De Ram was officially founded on 26 June 1985 and sits beautifully on the lively Albertusplein. For more than 40 years we have welcomed residents of Scherpenheuvel as well as visitors and pilgrims from far beyond. What once began as a beloved meeting place has grown over the years into an established favourite, where classic Belgian brasserie cuisine takes centre stage.",
    "about.story1.p2": "Our philosophy is simple: honest ingredients, generous portions and a welcome that feels like coming home. We believe that food brings people together. That's why we've created a place where families gather, friends laugh, and visitors rest after a stroll around the historic Basilica.",
    "about.story1.quote": "\"True hospitality lies in the details: a generous smile, a perfectly poured beer, and a plate of beef stew braised with love.\"",
    "about.story1.subtitle": "Since 26 June 1985",
    "about.story1.title": "A Trusted Favourite in Scherpenheuvel",
    "about.story2.p1": "In our kitchen, the chef wields the ladle with passion, working exclusively with tried-and-tested recipes passed down from generation to generation. Think of our legendary vol-au-vent (chicken vol-au-vent) with tender chicken and crispy puff pastry, or our deliciously tender beef stew braised in dark Belgian abbey beer.",
    "about.story2.p2": "Where possible, we choose ingredients from the local region. Our beers are carefully selected, ranging from well-known Belgian classics to local beers that reflect the character of our region. And to finish? We proudly serve our fresh waffles and pancakes.",
    "about.story2.subtitle": "Our Kitchen Philosophy",
    "about.story2.title": "Traditional Recipes & Local Produce",
    "about.value1.desc": "With us, you're not a number but a valued guest. Our close-knit team is ready to welcome and serve you with open arms.",
    "about.value1.title": "Generous Hospitality",
    "about.value2.desc": "We carefully select our suppliers. You'll taste the freshness of the meat, the crunch of the vegetables and the quality of the sauces.",
    "about.value2.title": "Honest Quality",
    "about.value3.desc": "Whether you sit inside in our atmospheric wooden interior or outside on our charming terrace, cosiness and comfort always come first.",
    "about.value3.title": "Cosy Enjoyment",
    "about.values.desc": "At De Ram, we strive every day to provide an excellent experience for all our guests. These are the pillars of our success.",
    "about.values.subtitle": "Our Values",
    "about.values.title": "What We Stand For",
    "features.card1.desc": "Our chef proudly prepares classic Flemish favourites, from artisanal beef stew and vol-au-vent to freshly baked Brussels waffles.",
    "features.card1.title": "Classic Cuisine",
    "features.card2.desc": "A warm, informal welcome where everyone immediately feels at home. Perfect for cosy family moments or a pleasant evening with friends.",
    "features.card2.title": "Family Atmosphere",
    "features.card3.desc": "Our extensive drinks menu features a fine selection of speciality beers that pair perfectly with our hearty brasserie dishes.",
    "features.card3.title": "Belgian Beers",
    "features.desc": "For many years a trusted favourite in Scherpenheuvel for families, groups and pilgrims seeking pure Belgian flavours.",
    "features.subtitle": "Welcome to De Ram",
    "features.title": "Why Our Guests Keep Coming Back",
